                <h1 class="content-title">SAM Pro <span class="gradient-text">Master Data Model &amp; Table Architecture</span></h1>
                <p class="content-subtitle">
                    Comprehensive relational architecture of ServiceNow Software Asset Management Professional. Explore schemas, foreign key connectivity, parent-child inheritance, default display fields, and 3-5 production records for all core tables across the 5 lifecycle layers.
                </p>
