            <section class="content-section" id="reconciliation-layer">
                <h2>4. Reconciliation Engine, Compliance Results &amp; Remediation Layer</h2>
                <p>
                    Reconciliation runs compare normalized installation counts against purchased entitlement rights across a 7-step sequence, writing audit headers, granular Effective License Position (ELP) records, and actionable remediation choices.
                </p>

                <!-- samp_reconciliation_result -->
                <div class="card-basic" style="margin-top: 24px; padding: 24px;">
                    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 12px;">
