                        <span class="badge badge-amber">Audit Header</span>
                    </div>
                    <p>
                        Header record for an execution of the SAM Reconciliation Engine. Captures run timestamp, publisher scope, enterprise compliance percentage, and total estimated true-up expenditure liability.
                    </p>

                    <h4>Field Dictionary (Default Schema)</h4>
                    <div class="data-table-wrapper">
                        <table class="data-table">
                            <thead>
