            <!-- 7. Layer 5: Reclamation & Spend Optimization -->
            <section class="content-section" id="reclamation-layer">
                <h2>5. Reclamation, Harvesting &amp; Spend Optimization Layer</h2>
                <p>
                    Software Reclamation automates the recovery of unused licenses. By evaluating runtime metering from SCCM, Jamf, and ACC, the engine flags inactive software, contacts users, and drives automated uninstalls.
                </p>

                <!-- samp_sw_reclamation_rule -->
                <div class="card-basic" style="margin-top: 24px; padding: 24px;">
                    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 12px;">
