                        <span class="badge badge-purple">Policy Governance</span>
                    </div>
                    <p>
                        Corporate policies establishing inactivity thresholds (e.g. 60 or 90 days), total execution hour minimums, and employee grace period notifications required to trigger license harvesting.
                    </p>

